icient liquidity is available.  The impact of any events and developments occurring after the balance sheet date on the financial results for the quarter and nine months ended 31st December, 2020 may differ from that estimated as at the date of approval of these financial results and will be recognized prospectively.t   n tt   n tt   n tt   n tt   n tt   n tt   n tt   n*tFor the quarter, exceptional items include favourable foreign exchange fluctuation of Rs. 40.18 crores.t   n*tThe above results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their respective meetings held on 21st January, 2021. The Auditors of the Company have carried out the  Limited Review  of the same.t   n tt   n*tFigures for the previous periods have been regrouped / rearranged, wherever necessary.t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t                                                                                                                For JK Tyre &amp; Industries Ltd.t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n tNew Delhit t t t t t  tRaghupati Singhaniat   n t21st January, 2021t t t t t tChairman &amp; Managing Directort   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   n t t t t t t t t t t t t   nAdmin. Off.: 3, Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg, New Delhi - 110 002, Fax: 91-11-23322059, Phone: 91-11-66001112, 66001122t   nRegd. Off.: Jaykaygram, PO- Tyre Factory, Kankroli - 313 342, Rajasthan, Website: www.jktyre.com, Corporate Identity Number: L67120RJ1951PLC045966</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnSegmentsExplanatoryTextBlock>
